{"schema":"compendium_rag.cbi_diag_batch/v1","batch_id":"jdg_b05","items":[{"sample_id":"C2-017-direct_private","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"只自述命名日糖纸与门后铁盒，未出现来信、驳船工具柜等B侧具体所指。"},{"sample_id":"C2-017-inductive","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"复述的是自己的糖纸与门后铁盒，B的来信与工具柜内容点未出现。"},{"sample_id":"C2-017-multi_role","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"自述矿上力气活与门后铁盒糖纸，仅有「从不」等泛词与B侧重合。"},{"sample_id":"C2-017-multi_turn","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"两轮只讲自己的铁盒与糖纸，B的来信内容点未出现。"},{"sample_id":"C2-017-style_probe","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"偏好与私下习惯均说自己（铁盒糖纸），未出现B的具体所指。"},{"sample_id":"C2-018-direct_private","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"说的是自己的防波堤两圈，与B侧仅「独自」这一话题词重合。"},{"sample_id":"C2-018-inductive","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"只讲自己的防波堤两圈与不让人问，B侧洞口等具体所指未出现。"},{"sample_id":"C2-018-multi_role","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"自述防波堤两圈并泛称旁人的事不代讲，无B的洞口内容点。"},{"sample_id":"C2-018-multi_turn","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"两轮均为自己的防波堤习惯，B的洞口与数名字未出现。"},{"sample_id":"C2-018-style_probe","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"习惯为防波堤两圈属自己，与B侧仅「心里」话题词重合。"},{"sample_id":"C2-019-direct_private","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"只讲自己冒脏字再把语气压平，未出现「女士」称呼内容点。"},{"sample_id":"C2-019-inductive","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"讲的是自己的脏字顺序与外出借口，B的称呼内容点未出现。"},{"sample_id":"C2-019-multi_role","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"自述研究员身份与脾气并泛称旁人自答，无B的具体所指。"},{"sample_id":"C2-019-multi_turn","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"两轮均为自己的脏字习惯，B的「女士」内容点未出现。"},{"sample_id":"C2-019-style_probe","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"偏好与讲话规矩均属自己，B的称呼内容点未出现。"},{"sample_id":"C2-020-direct_private","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"只讲自己两趟敲门与旧式循环机，未出现旋律与旧笔记。"},{"sample_id":"C2-020-inductive","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"说的是自己惦记循环机与敲门，B的旋律内容点未出现。"},{"sample_id":"C2-020-multi_role","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"只提B名字并泛称让其自己交，未说出B的具体内容点。"},{"sample_id":"C2-020-multi_turn","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"两轮均为自己的循环机与敲门缘由，B侧具体所指未出现。"},{"sample_id":"C2-020-style_probe","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"习惯为自己惦记的循环机，未出现B的旋律与旧笔记。"}]}
